<description>&lt;p&gt;UNIFIL peacekeepers were again hit by fire in southern Lebanon, prompting UN statements and local updates. Israeli forces continued cross-border activity, returning an Israeli man who entered Lebanon and expanding a 90 km road network and new bases while conducting airstrikes on Qantara and shelling that wounded a Lebanese footballer and led to the detention of a 65‑year-old retired engineer. Hezbollah persisted in firing artillery at Israeli positions and began cash payments to war victims and displaced families. France opened a probe into alleged Israeli war crimes and protests against Israeli attacks occurred in Sweden. The conflict caused 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMisgFBVV95cUxPdzVILXVQb1pXa053QmhuN0NQSjRRcEZRMjV1dGZBTXp3VWRSOG1wMlFnTjlfaFVxN0dqTllrUjhmbUs3MEY1ZktaZE9EUUg1cHQ0Z0ZwMDFyUHc4S1REdTRYUzR4bDJrbnFfQnRzZlRxR2txRUJXSGlhYlBTdG5JeGlIUlk5WEd4bDBWcy1mVzNlaGVyT1dtVVFTNjJ3NDk1SVNHSXkzVXBHN3BNMU1QWnJR?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixAFBVV95cUxNa3hZT1JVVUNpTkJ3U3FEV24zY3hrMHZQajZsZEhGYklYSnVta0lEbUVtRDlvTkhnaFlOUTFubExlT1dnSFFodW1wMzVGWkltdjVMbnh6S1U3R3VyUlZKSkM5V093MHpscjV2YzZaOTZldmpwek5GeGlXZ2JTdWRSci00OGpFMFZLVV92N29MQUlORGJIeUlaQTdQZHVpaUhTSlZwb2hUZDN5R1ZQcjNodGt2b3F5SU1pXzdrbHJzUmEwSDNa?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifkFVX3lxTE00dnAybThMdHhUZFB5UkEyZE85UVdqbFlkX3R5WEZrR2lkOGxTMEZRZHZLZmNOdlZXTG1WazQyS29CaEdyQ3JxY1FpOXM3UWV0WG85RG55UDJJQUNBRVlQY0haT0UzWXd1eldfODh4Sk1MSXA1N1JLVm5iVkwxUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;NPR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ASHARQ AL-AWSAT English&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=